<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility 96 net CZK 414.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Czech utility 96 net CZK 414.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary, unaudited results</p>
<p>for period ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Net profit     414.315    vs     281.047</p>
<p> Production	4,642.838    vs     4,156.635</p>
<p> Basic Capital   4,147.877    vs     4,147.877</p>
<p> Total Assets    7,052.092    vs     7,315.443</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is Prazska Teplarenska a.s., a Prague-based heating utility.</p>
<p>A company official told Reuters the increase in profit was due in large part to a rise in the number of the firm's residential consumers. She added that the firm does not plan to pay a dividend for 1996. It did not pay a dividend on 1995 profits.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
